<title>DUBAI: Iran's NIOC increases bunker fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Iran's NIOC increases bunker fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Iranian Oil Company (NIOC) has increased the ex-wharf price of its straight run fuel from Kharg Island by $1.50 a tonne to $101 a tonne with effect from July 31, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bunker fuel from Bandar Mahshahr is up 50 cents from July 17 levels to $96 a tonne.</p>
</text>
